					"content": "我們下來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430202,
					"content": "這裡就是月心嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430203,
					"content": "#不，月心還在前面。這次有{F#妳}{M#你}同行，我們就得用常規方法進入那裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430204,
					"content": "至於這裡…是那位漆黑龍王的傑作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430205,
					"content": "他將月球改造成了可怕的武器，這裡就是武器的發射井。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430206,
					"content": "而月心中的月亮本源力量，就成了射向提瓦特的炮火。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430207,
					"content": "不過，那位原初之主最終還是敗於天理手中。現在這裡已經不會再有威脅了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430208,
					"content": "我們往前走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				}
			]
