				{
					"id": 761430510,
					"content": "#哥倫比婭？{NICKNAME}？{F#妳}{M#你}們的臉色怎麼都那麼沉重啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430511,
					"content": "因為她的使命中存在不可知的風險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430512,
					"content": "什麼風險？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430513,
					"content": "等你讀取了這裡面的資訊，你就知道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430514,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430515,
					"content": "我有點不明白了，黑蛋的使命到底是什麼啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430516,
					"content": "#在黑蛋讀取資訊的同時，{F#妳}{M#你}們將一切告訴了派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430517,
					"content": "向星空中發送訊息？原來這就是望月者計畫的內容…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430518,
					"content": "所以風險是…這可能會讓提瓦特暴露？怎麼會這樣…好為難！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430519,
					"content": "黑蛋…你還好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430520,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430521,
					"content": "哎呀，你先別傷心啊。我們還可以再商量一下對不對？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430522,
					"content": "給你零食，我們五五開！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430523,
					"content": "不，我沒有傷心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430524,
					"content": "你都流眼淚了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430525,
					"content": "我不傷心，眼淚也沒有流，這只是…這只是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430526,
					"content": "是敬給前輩們的酒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430527,
					"content": "#哥倫比婭、{NICKNAME}、派蒙，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430528,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們是我的朋友，我不想讓朋友為難，所以我願意…放棄這個使命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430529,
					"content": "黑蛋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430530,
					"content": "沒關係，派蒙。我不是第一個執行望月者計畫的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430531,
					"content": "我的前輩，早就向星空發出了屬於我們的聲音。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430532,
					"content": "那些充滿勇氣的聲音，一定已經傳遞到很遠很遠的星空深處了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430533,
					"content": "只要有那些聲音在，星空就不會是一片死寂，那樣就足夠了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430534,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}…{F#妳}{M#你}考慮好了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430535,
						761430546
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430535,
					"content": "也許可以最後執行一次望月者計畫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430536
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430536,
					"content": "嗯，我也這麼想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430537,
					"content": "真、真的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430538,
					"content": "我們真的可以冒一次險嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430539,
					"content": "迄今為止，望月者計畫已經執行了不只一次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430540,
					"content": "用來隱藏提瓦特的虛假之天，也已經被打開了不只一次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430541,
					"content": "霜月曾在虛假之天外存在了數千年，現在月球上也並沒有出現深淵汙染的痕跡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430542,
					"content": "哦？妳是說，也許並沒有想像中那麼危險？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430543
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430543,
					"content": "可能性有很多，也許深淵不是每時每刻都盯著這裡，也許是高天的主宰做了其他措施…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430544
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430544,
					"content": "而為了把風險降到最低，我也會用月神的力量，掩護寧寧發出的訊息。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430545
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430545,
					"content": "欸？那是什麼意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430549
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430549,
					"content": "月矩力和古月之力本質上都是光界力，我可以將我的力量融入寧寧發出的訊息中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430550
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430550,
					"content": "等到那些訊息穿越虛假之天後，我還可以透過那些力量，監測附近的情況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430551
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430551,
					"content": "一旦有危險，我可以將資訊抹除。這樣一來，我們就不會被發現。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430552
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430552,
					"content": "哦？這好像是個好辦法！但妳的力量…可以一直維持嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430553
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430553,
					"content": "唔，我的力量也有極限，只能堅持到一定距離。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430554
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430554,
					"content": "我會盡全力，把它送去我能抵達的極限。屆時它的來源也不會被輕易定位了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430555
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430555,
					"content": "這樣聽起來比較可行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430556
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430556,
					"content": "可是…這會讓妳受傷嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430557
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430557,
					"content": "放心。支持著我們的，是一整個月亮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430558
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430558,
					"content": "那黑蛋你做好準備了嗎？一旦決定，可就無法回頭了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430559
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430559,
					"content": "…我能再問一個問題嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430560
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430560,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430561
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430561,
					"content": "#為什麼{F#妳}{M#你}們願意為我做這些？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430562
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430562,
					"content": "我們可是朋友啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430563
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430563,
					"content": "就這個？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430564
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430564,
					"content": "足夠了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430565,
						761430566
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430565,
					"content": "望月者…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430567
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430567,
					"content": "我、我也是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430568
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430568,
					"content": "我明白了，那麼，我做好準備了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430569
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430569,
					"content": "我的誕生，就是為了這一刻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430570
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430570,
					"content": "嗯，向星空發出你的聲音吧，提瓦特的月光會送你遠航。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430571
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430571,
					"content": "呃…你好…你們好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430572
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430572,
					"content": "很高興…能夠向神秘又浩瀚的星空送出這則訊息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430573
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430573,
					"content": "我不知道它能否被接收…但我想，它至少能為冰冷的宇宙驅散一些死寂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430574
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430574,
					"content": "如果真的有一個你聽見了，那證明一定存在著某種特別的引力，像月亮一樣，捕捉了我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430575
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430575,
					"content": "所以，我希望你們的文明知道…在這片無垠的星空下，你們並不孤單。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430576
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430576,
					"content": "我們的時代快要落幕了…但我們的勇氣、信念、智慧會和這道渺小的訊息一起迴盪在星海間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430577
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430577,
					"content": "它微不足道，但它是我們的光…我希望它能鼓舞你們——在這片星空下，你們不是在獨自地迎接未知與黑暗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430578
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430578,
					"content": "請繼續向星空發出屬於你們的聲音吧，讓它也成為你們的光。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430579
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430579,
					"content": "一束光很微弱，很容易會被黑暗吞沒，但只要在它消失前有另一束光亮起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430580
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430580,
					"content": "那麼總有一天，總有一束光，會成為刺破夜幕的曙光。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430581
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430581,
					"content": "最後…我們是…宇宙中一個不起眼角落裡的…望月{RUBY#[S]星空}者…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430582
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430582,
					"content": "我們的名字是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430583
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430583,
					"content": "伊比尼伯龍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430584
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430584,
					"content": "烏吉恩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430585
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430585,
					"content": "瑪歌潔蒂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430586
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430586,
					"content": "盧沙里姆…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430587
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430587,
					"content": "寧希基婭…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430588
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430588,
					"content": "向所有能聽見的你…致意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430589
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430589,
					"content": "朋友們…謝謝…我們在星空下…再見吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430590
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430590,
					"content": "黑蛋完成了她的使命…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430591
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430591,
					"content": "她的帽子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430592
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430592,
					"content": "妳還好嗎，哥倫比婭？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430593
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430593,
					"content": "我沒問題。不過接下來，我需要集中注意力，直到我的力量達到極限。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430594
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430594,
					"content": "那我們快去找一個安靜的地方吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430595
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430595,
					"content": "再見了，黑蛋，我會永遠記得你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430596
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430596,
					"content": "（…一陣訊號雜音…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430597
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430597,
					"content": "（…似乎因為望月者模組的啟動，無意間開啟了一段塵封的資料…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430598
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430598,
					"content": "…這裡是…號…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430599
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430599,
					"content": "…已接收…訊息…並向你…答覆…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431201
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431201,
					"content": "…因為無法準確定位座標…不知需要多久…回訊才能抵達你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431202,
					"content": "…但我想要…在此時此刻…應答…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431203,
					"content": "…我們是在宇宙間…孤獨穿行許久的旅者…而你們的聲音…就像黑暗森林中突然燃起的篝火…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431204,
					"content": "…這很冒險…卻又無畏…讓我們感到振奮與溫暖…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431205,
					"content": "…我相信…這個時刻…是星海與命運的引力…將你我連接在一起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431206,
					"content": "…未來…我們會嘗試…尋找你們…星球…但很遺憾不是現在…因為還有一些…的麻煩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431207,
					"content": "（…一陣干擾的雜音…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431208,
					"content": "#…{M#哥哥！好了嗎？}{F#熒，怎麼樣了？}",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431209,
					"content": "#…{M#熒，馬上來}{F#哥哥，馬上好}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431210,
					"content": "（…一陣干擾的雜音…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431211,
					"content": "…那麼…向你致意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431212,
					"content": "…就像你說的，星海廣闊無垠，我們並不孤單…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431213,
					"content": "…願我們有天能在星空下再見…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "終端機"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430566,
					"content": "我向所有的你們致意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430567
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430546,
					"content": "雖然很遺憾，但我們不能冒險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430547
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761430547,
					"content": "如果說，我可以用月神的力量，掩護寧寧發出的訊息呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430548
